      "writtenOn": "2026-07-01T16:32:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Checking for hasLock would be fine, using hasLock would be subtly different -- it would check if the lock is still valid.  That\u0027s a slightly different change than this, which was intended to narrowly address an error the preceding changes in this stack (since merged) corrected: we were missing a lock.\n\nIt would probably be okay to also check for lock validity here, though it should typically already be validated in sessionIsInvalid above, so probably isn\u0027t a practical difference.  Let\u0027s consider it separately; I\u0027ll make a followup.",
      "parentUuid": "5fab7cea_9a8ced60",
