      "writtenOn": "2026-07-01T16:32:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is more of a programming error than something we should try to recover from.  Generally LockException is used for \"oops we didn\u0027t get the lock\"; this is \"programmer forgot to use a lock\".  In other words, if we catch this exception explicitly, we\u0027re probably making a second mistake.",
      "parentUuid": "0b5979b6_ecd7f52a",
